    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A semi-barbaric king devises a cruel trial in which a young man must choose between two doorsone hiding a deadly tiger and the other a beautiful ladywhile the jealous princess, who knows the secret behind the doors, secretly influences his fate.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
