    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Color Purple is the story of two sisters--one a missionary to Africa and the other a child wife living in the South--who remain loyal to one another across time, distance, and silence. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
