    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A collection of stories, whose characters give voice to the vibrant and varied life on both sides of the Mexican border. The women in these stories offer tales of pure discovery, filled with moments of infinite and intimate wisdom.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
