    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A memoir that recounts the Elie Wiesel's experiences as a Jewish teenager during the Holocaust, which included the loss of family, starvation, violence, and the threat of death. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
