    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A woman kills her husband with a frozen leg of lamb after he informs her he is leaving her, then cleverly covers up the crime by cooking and serving the lamb to the investigating detectives.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
