    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The tragic story of two itinerant ranch hands on the run during the Great Depression--one is the lifelong companion to the other, a developmentally disabled man.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
