    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Stevens, an English butler, takes a road trip across the English countryside, during which he reflects on his decades of loyal service to Lord Darlington, his interactions with the spirited housekeeper Miss Kenton, and the moments that shaped his life in the grandeur of Darlington Hall</TTEXTS:has_summary>
